-- Regulation W, 12 CFR Part 223, covered transactions: the nouns.
--
-- Target compiler: main (see NOTES.md).
-- This module holds DECLARE and nothing else: the things a witness could state about a proposed or
-- existing transaction.  The rules are in the modules that import it.

IMPORT prelude

§ `What the member bank does`

-- 223.3(h): "Covered transaction with respect to an affiliate means: (1) An extension of credit to the
-- affiliate; (2) A purchase of, or an investment in, a security issued by the affiliate; (3) A purchase
-- of an asset from the affiliate ...; (4) The acceptance of a security issued by the affiliate as
-- collateral for an extension of credit to any person or company; and (5) The issuance of a guarantee,
-- acceptance, or letter of credit ... on behalf of the affiliate, a confirmation of a letter of credit
-- issued by the affiliate, and a cross-affiliate netting arrangement."
DECLARE `Transaction kind` IS ONE OF
    `An extension of credit`
    `A purchase of, or an investment in, a security`
    `A purchase of an asset`
    `The acceptance of a security as collateral for an extension of credit`
    `The issuance of a guarantee, acceptance or letter of credit, or the confirmation of a letter of credit`
    `A cross-affiliate netting arrangement`
    `Some other transaction`

-- One transaction, at one instant.
DECLARE Transaction HAS
    `kind`                IS A `Transaction kind`
    -- the person the member bank deals with: the borrower, the seller, the issuer, the account party
    `with`                IS A STRING
    -- the affiliate the transaction relates to: the borrower, the seller of the asset, the issuer of the
    -- security bought or taken as collateral, the party on whose behalf a guarantee is issued
    `affiliate concerned` IS A STRING
    -- the value of the transaction under 223.21 to 223.24 (regwb-valuation.l4), stated
    `value`               IS A NUMBER
    -- 223.3(h)(3): "except such purchases of real and personal property as may be specifically exempted
    -- by the Board by order or regulation" (an order: stated)
    `exempted by the Board as a purchase of property` IS A BOOLEAN

-- 223.16(a) and (b): what became of the proceeds of a transaction with a person who is not an affiliate.
DECLARE `Use of proceeds` HAS
    `amount used for the benefit of, or transferred to, an affiliate` IS A NUMBER
    `used to purchase an asset through an affiliate acting exclusively as agent or broker` IS A BOOLEAN
    `asset not issued, underwritten or sold as principal by any affiliate` IS A BOOLEAN
    `agency fee, brokerage commission or other compensation an affiliate receives from the proceeds` IS A NUMBER

-- 223.41, 223.42 and 223.16(c) each say a transaction is "not subject to" some of the requirements.
DECLARE `Exemption claimed` IS ONE OF
    `No exemption`
    `An exemption under 223.41`
    `An exemption under 223.42`
    `An exemption under 223.16(c)`

§ `Collateral`

-- 223.14(b)(1): the kinds of collateral and the percentage each must stand at; (c): what is not
-- eligible collateral.
DECLARE `Collateral kind` IS ONE OF
    `Obligations of the United States or its agencies`
    `Obligations fully guaranteed by the United States or its agencies as to principal and interest`
    `Notes, drafts, bills of exchange or bankers' acceptances eligible for rediscount or purchase by a Federal Reserve Bank`
    `A segregated, earmarked deposit account with the member bank for the sole purpose of securing credit transactions with affiliates`
    `Obligations of a State or political subdivision of a State`
    `Other debt instruments, including loans and other receivables`
    `Stock, leases, or other real or personal property`
    `A low-quality asset`
    `A security issued by an affiliate`
    `An equity security of the member bank, or a debt security of the member bank that represents regulatory capital`
    `An intangible asset (including a servicing asset)`
    `A guarantee, letter of credit or other similar instrument`

DECLARE Collateral HAS
    `kind`                         IS A `Collateral kind`
    `market value`                 IS A NUMBER
    -- 223.14(d)(2): the amount of any security interest in it senior to the member bank's, and the
    -- amount of any credit secured by it that is senior to the member bank's
    `senior security interest`     IS A NUMBER
    `senior credit`                IS A NUMBER
    -- 223.14(c)(4): "unless specifically approved by the Board"
    `approved by the Board`        IS A BOOLEAN
    -- 223.14(d)(1): a perfected and enforceable security interest
    `perfected and enforceable`    IS A BOOLEAN

§ `Assets`

-- 223.3(v): what makes an asset a low-quality asset.
DECLARE `Asset condition` HAS
    -- (1): "classified as 'substandard,' 'doubtful,' or 'loss,' or treated as 'special mention' or 'other
    -- transfer risk problems,' either in the most recent report of examination or inspection of an
    -- affiliate ... or in any internal classification system used by the member bank or the affiliate"
    `classified or specially treated`        IS A BOOLEAN
    -- (2): "in a nonaccrual status"
    `in nonaccrual status`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    -- (3): "principal or interest payments are more than thirty days past due"
    `days past due`                          IS A NUMBER
    -- (4): "terms have been renegotiated or compromised due to the deteriorating financial condition of the obligor"
    `renegotiated because of deterioration`  IS A BOOLEAN
    -- (5): "acquired through foreclosure, repossession, or otherwise in satisfaction of a debt previously
    -- contracted, if the asset has not yet been reviewed in an examination or inspection"
    `acquired in satisfaction of a debt and not yet reviewed` IS A BOOLEAN

-- 223.14(f): the collateral requirements "do not apply to the following transactions".
DECLARE `Collateral exceptions` HAS
    -- (f)(1): "An acceptance that already is fully secured either by attached documents or by other property
    -- that is involved in the transaction and has an ascertainable market value."
    `an acceptance already fully secured` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- (f)(2): "The unused portion of an extension of credit to an affiliate as long as the member bank does not
    -- have any legal obligation to advance additional funds under the extension of credit until the affiliate
    -- provides the amount of collateral required ... with respect to the entire used portion (including the
    -- amount of the requested advance)"
    `unused portion` IS A NUMBER
    `no obligation to advance until the required collateral is provided` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- (f)(3): "The purchase of a debt security issued by an affiliate as long as the member bank purchases the
    -- debt security from a nonaffiliate in a bona fide secondary market transaction."
    `a debt security of an affiliate bought from a nonaffiliate in a bona fide secondary market` IS A BOOLEAN

§ `Participations in loans`

-- 223.15(b)(3): "The participating member bank's share of the renewal or extension of additional credit does not
-- exceed its proportional share of the original transaction by more than 5 percent".
DECLARE `Five percent reading` IS ONE OF
    `Five percentage points above the proportional share`
    `Five percent more than the proportional share`

-- 223.15(b): the renewal of, or extension of additional credit with respect to, a member bank's participation in
-- a loan to a nonaffiliate that was originated by an affiliate.
DECLARE `Participation renewal` HAS
    `is such a renewal or extension` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- (b)(1)
    `the loan was not a low-quality asset when the bank bought its participation` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- (b)(2)
    `approved by the board of directors of the participating member bank` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the originating affiliate is a depository institution` IS A BOOLEAN
    `approved by an executive committee of the board` IS A BOOLEAN
    `approved by one or more senior management officials` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the board approved standards for such renewals` IS A BOOLEAN
    `each renewal meets the standards` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the board periodically reviews the renewals and the standards` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- (b)(3): both as a percentage of the transaction
    `the bank's share of the renewal` IS A NUMBER
    `the bank's proportional share of the original transaction` IS A NUMBER
    `the appropriate Federal banking agency gave prior written approval` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- (b)(4): "not later than 20 days after consummation"
    `days from consummation to written notice` IS A NUMBER
